3. LEFT JOIN Query

Display all influencers and their posts, including influencers without any posts. If no post exists, show 'No Posts'.

```sql
SELECT
    i.name,
    COALESCE(p.caption, 'No Posts') AS caption
FROM influencers i
LEFT JOIN posts p
ON i.influencer_id = p.influencer_id;
```

If an influencer has no posts, the result will display:

| name           | caption  |
| -------------- | -------- |
| New Influencer | No Posts |

4. RIGHT JOIN Query

Display all posts and the corresponding influencer name. If a post does not have a matching influencer, show NULL for the influencer name.

```sql
SELECT
    p.post_id,
    p.caption,
    i.name
FROM influencers i
